# Task m3-01-profile-schema
Create Zod schemas and inferred types for the candidate data.

BankSchema (experience bank):
  basics: { name, email, phone, location: string; links: string[] }
  summaries: array of { id, variant, text: string }
  roles: array of Entry; projects: array of Entry, where Entry =
    { id, title, company, location, dates: string; bullets: Bullet[] }
    (for projects, company and location may be empty strings)
  Bullet = { id: string matching /^[a-z0-9-]+-\d+$/, text: string, short: string,
    tags: string[] (1 to 12 items, lowercase), impact: "high" | "medium" | "low" }
  education: array of { id, degree, school, dates: string; details: string[] }
  skills: { languages, frameworks, tools, domains: string[] }
  approved: boolean, default false
  meta: optional { model: string, prompt_version: string, created_at: string }

SkillsExtraSchema: { skills: array of { name: string (lowercase),
  status: "have" | "dont_have", evidence: string (may be empty for dont_have),
  added_at: string } }

PreferencesSchema: matches profile/preferences.yaml:
  compensation { currency, unit: string; min, target: number; keep_if_unlisted: boolean }
  roles: array of { title: string; aliases: string[] default []; suggested: boolean optional }
  seniority { include, exclude: string[] }
  location { cities: string[]; remote, hybrid, onsite: boolean }
  visa_sponsorship_needed: boolean
  companies { include: array of { name, slug: string; ats: "auto" | "greenhouse" | "lever" | "ashby" }; exclude: string[] }
  tailoring { bullets_per_role, bullets_total, max_words: positive ints }

ResumeRecordSchema (one per JD, stored as YAML):
  resume_id, jd_id: string; source_resume_id: string | null; created_at: string
  jd_suitability_score, content_equivalence_score: number 0..100
  decision: "reuse" | "adapt" | "assemble"; flag_gaps: boolean; gaps: string[]; review: boolean
  changes: array of { bullet_id: string; from: string | null; to: string | null; reason: string }
  evidence_refs: array of { requirement: string; bullet_ids: string[] }
  content: { summary_variant: string; summary_text: string;
    sections: array of { entry_id: string; bullets: array of { id, text: string } } }
  meta: optional { model: string, prompt_version: string }

Export each schema and its type (Bank, Bullet, Entry, SkillsExtra, Preferences, ResumeRecord).
